[SPEAKER_01]: Suffering is there.

754
00:56:56,912 --> 00:56:59,293
[SPEAKER_01]: So, for Sarvabhāna, that little suffering will be suffering.

755
00:56:59,989 --> 00:57:00,769
[SPEAKER_01]: But, again, not.

756
00:57:01,470 --> 00:57:04,831
[SPEAKER_01]: Like, if he were to remember how he used to suffer, of course, he won't suffer.

757
